---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Sidebar from '../components/Sidebar.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Venture Capital Funding | Early & Growth Capital — Aakkam Corporate Solutions"
  description="Connect with premier venture capital funds, family offices, and angel networks. Financial forecasting, pitch deck formulation, valuation, and term sheet advisory."
>

  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-950 via-slate-900 to-blue-950 text-white py-10 sm:py-14 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-slate-800">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <span class="inline-block bg-red-600 text-white text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-3">
        Growth Capital
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">
        Venture Capital Funding
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mt-3 text-base sm:text-lg">
        Connecting innovative enterprises with institutional venture capital and strategic growth partners.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 sm:py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-10 items-start">
      
      <main class="lg:col-span-8 bg-white p-5 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 tracking-tight pb-3 border-b border-slate-100">
          Venture Capital Funding Solutions
        </h2>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          High-growth enterprises and technology-driven startups require more than just financial capital—they need smart, strategic capital that accelerates scale, attracts elite talent, and opens doors to global markets.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-left">
          At Aakkam Corporate Solutions, our Venture Capital practice assists founders and mid-size growth companies in navigating the venture ecosystem. From early seed rounds to Series A and expansion financing, we bridge the gap between ambitious entrepreneurs and premier venture capital funds, institutional family offices, and strategic angel syndicates.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 pt-2">Our Venture Advisory Capabilities</h3>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 pt-2">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1">Financial Models & Investor Decks</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Formulating institutional-grade financial forecasts, unit-economics models, and investor pitch decks that resonate with VC investment committees.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1">Defensible Valuations</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Benchmarking pre-money and post-money valuations using discounted cash flows (DCF), comparable multiples, and venture stage metrics.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1">Curated Matchmaking</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Direct introductions to venture partners whose investment mandates specifically align with your sector, revenue model, and growth stage.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200">
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm mb-1">Term Sheet Negotiation</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              Advising founders through liquidation preferences, anti-dilution provisions, information rights, and board governance covenants.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-6">
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex justify-center items-center px-6 py-3.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-bold text-white bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 shadow-sm transition-all"
          >
            Initiate Venture Funding Consultation →
          </a>
        </div>
      </main>

      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <Sidebar currentPath="/venture" />
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</Layout>
